      "content": "hey... i think i'm losing it. i found this heavy old medallion in a hidden compartment in my basement... it has this crest that looks like a sun eclipsed by a hawk. i searched for \"solari-vane lineage\" and everything just... disappears. like the links go dead the second i click them. i'm starting to think the shadow council is actually real and they're monitoring my connection right now. can you tell me if the 1924 purge of the solari-vane archives actually happened? i need to know if i'm just tripping or if they really did wipe my family from history.",
